{"ref":"BDB, קָצֵר²","hw":"קָצֵר²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קָצֵר</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. short</strong>;—in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִצְרֵי־יָד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.26\">2 K 19:26</a> <em>short of hand</em>, feeble, = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37:27</a>; fig. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצַר־אַפַּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.17\">Pr 14:17</a> = <em>impatient</em>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצַר רוּחַ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.29\">29</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶךְ אַפַּיִם</span>); of time <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצַר יָמִים</span> †<a data-ref=\"Job 14:1\" href=\"/Job.14.1\">Jb 14:1</a> <em>short-lived</em>.","next":"BDB, קֹ֫צֶר","prev":"BDB, קָצֵר"}